  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Runs the script of each sprite 7-0 with sprite_script bit 7 set. Other sprites stop moving."},
    {"at":14,"placement":"side","text":"No script: clears the direction bits."},
    {"at":22,"placement":"line","text":"Steps the script of sprite X. A step has 4 bytes: directions, speeds, frames, command."},
    {"at":27,"placement":"side","text":"Gets the script pointer from the table at $cce3."},
    {"at":47,"placement":"side","text":"Reads the next step: byte 3 command, byte 2 frames, byte 1 speeds, byte 0 directions."},
    {"at":73,"placement":"side","text":"Low nibble: Y speed. High nibble: X speed."},
    {"at":92,"placement":"side","text":"Counts down the frames of the step."},
    {"at":96,"placement":"line","text":"At the end of a step, command 1 reads a new script and a new animation."},
    {"at":131,"placement":"side","text":"Command 2: the next byte is the new script."},
    {"at":151,"placement":"side","text":"Command 3: goes to step n of the script."},
    {"at":176,"placement":"side","text":"Command 4: stops the script and the animation and switches the sprite off."},
    {"at":196,"placement":"side","text":"Other command: the next byte is a sound request for voice 1."},
    {"at":217,"placement":"line","text":"Sets the step frames, step command and script offset of sprite X to 0. Out: A = 0."}
  ],
